#. y1:english="I'm tired. {PA:20}So tired...\nWhat happened?\nHear me out, {PA:10}man.\nThe bar closed at 6 in the morning,||and I've been with this old bag ever since.\nI had to keep caressing||this old woman's ass for hours.\n...I see.\nIsn't that fucked up?{PA:10}||Shota sends all the ugly women to me.\nI can't stand it anymore!\nSorry to bother you...\nReally.\nWhat? {PA:10}What's with the attitude?{PA:20}||You think this shit is easy?\nI work at a bar called Stardust on||Tenkaichi St. Stop by and say what's up."
