#. y1:english="Hey,{PA:10}||lemme ask you something.\nHey, {PA:10}what, {PA:10}we didn't do anything wrong!!\nYeah! {PA:10}We got our passports and everything!\nDon't worry, I'm not the police.\nI just heard you say,||\"You're all better now!\"\nOh, {PA:10}yeah, {PA:10}that.||Dr. Enomoto {PA:10}is {PA:10}a good doctor.\nWhere can I find Dr. Enomoto?\nCan I tell him?\nDr. Enomoto might get angry...\nHe said he didn't want a lot of people||knowing about him.\nThis kid's really sick.||I gotta get him to a doctor!\nAlright. I'll tell you.\nDr. Enomoto is in a building||on the same street as {MS:0}Akagyu.\nAlright, got it!{PA:10}\nBe sure not to tell anyone, please!\nI owe Enomoto-san a lot.||Please!\nOkay, {PA:10}I won't, don't worry.\n"
